I was playing NH31-- for a while, but I've given up.  There is one type
of monster that is just far too deadly for the levels they show up on.
The berator (q) seems not much more powerful than, say, a rothe, except
that half the time when it hits you, you are infected with a fatal disease
and die in about 6 rounds.  Since they come in packs of four, praying is
no good, because your prayer timeout is too high.  One infects you, so
you pray, kill it, and then the other three infect you and you die.
	The worst thing is that they show up at relatively low levels.
I was a 10th level samurai with Snickersnee, -3 AC, 105 HP, and the game
was looking fairly promising.  Two packs of berators later and I was dead
of a fatal disease.  I had met no unicorns, so that was that.
	Anyway, I'd recommend against NH31-- for this sole reason.

